  "post_content": "<p>(14 fotos) Adela Prades Juan ha ganado el cheque de 200 euros del sorteo por utilizar la tarjeta de fidelizaci&oacute;n del Mercado Municipal de Onda. A Mari Carmen Gay Casalta&nbsp;le ha correpondido el cheque de 100 euros. Carmen Insa Colera, Carmen Llopico March, Arantxa Meseguer de Dios y Francisca Ballester Borr&aacute;s se levan 50 euros cada una para gastar en las paradas del mercado durante el mes de octubre.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/09/IMG_2366.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>El alcalde, Ximo Huguet Lecha, y el presidente de la Asociaci&oacute;n de Vendedores del Mercado Municipal y Pescater&iacute;a, Salvador March, han sigo algunas de las personas que han apretado el bot&oacute;n dela suerte en el programa inform&aacute;tico.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigtargetafidelitzaciomercatmunicipalonda/img_2343.jpg\" alt=\"img_2343\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigtargetafidelitzaciomercatmunicipalonda/img_2347.jpg\" alt=\"img_2347\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigtargetafidelitzaciomercatmunicipalonda/img_2348.jpg\" alt=\"img_2348\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigtargetafidelitzaciomercatmunicipalonda/img_2350.jpg\" alt=\"img_2350\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigtargetafidelitzaciomercatmunicipalonda/img_2351.jpg\" alt=\"img_2351\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigtargetafidelitzaciomercatmunicipalonda/img_2353.jpg\" alt=\"img_2353\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigtargetafidelitzaciomercatmunicipalonda/img_2354.jpg\" alt=\"img_2354\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigtargetafidelitzaciomercatmunicipalonda/img_2355.jpg\" alt=\"img_2355\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigtargetafidelitzaciomercatmunicipalonda/img_2357.jpg\" alt=\"img_2357\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigtargetafidelitzaciomercatmunicipalonda/img_2358.jpg\" alt=\"img_2358\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigtargetafidelitzaciomercatmunicipalonda/img_2360.jpg\" alt=\"img_2360\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigtargetafidelitzaciomercatmunicipalonda/img_2363.jpg\" alt=\"img_2363\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigtargetafidelitzaciomercatmunicipalonda/img_2366.jpg\" alt=\"img_2366\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigtargetafidelitzaciomercatmunicipalonda/img_2368.jpg\" alt=\"img_2368\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
